CM_ "Baja DAQ CAN spec v0 (frozen Oct 19 2026). CAN 2.0A, 1 Mbit/s, little-endian. All-ones raw value (0xFF, 0xFFFF, 0x7FFF signed) = not available. Owner: Toph Jones.";
